  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "text": "Two thirds of the people who file India's income tax return owe nothing.",
      "start": 0.8,
      "dur": 5.221,
      "end": 6.021
    },
    {
      "id": "l02",
      "scene": "s1",
      "text": "They are not debtors. They are creditors, waiting on their own money.",
      "start": 6.371,
      "dur": 5.591,
      "end": 11.962
    },
    {
      "id": "l03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "text": "This is the most common thing the portal says to them.",
      "start": 12.462,
      "dur": 3.287,
      "end": 15.749
    },
    {
      "id": "l04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "text": "It is not an error message. It is a shrug.",
      "start": 16.499,
      "dur": 3.878,
      "end": 20.376
    },
    {
      "id": "l05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "text": "Here is the same failure, told truthfully.",
      "start": 20.876,
      "dur": 3.357,
      "end": 24.233
    },
    {
      "id": "l06",
      "scene": "s3",
      "text": "The department already holds her salary, and the tax taken from it.",
      "start": 27.433,
      "dur": 5.089,
      "end": 32.522
    },
    {
      "id": "l07",
      "scene": "s3",
      "text": "So stop asking people to compose a return.",
      "start": 32.872,
      "dur": 3.46,
      "end": 36.333
    },
    {
      "id": "l08",
      "scene": "s3",
      "text": "Ask them to confirm one.",
      "start": 36.633,
      "dur": 2.004,
      "end": 38.637
    },
    {
      "id": "l09",
      "scene": "s3",
      "text": "Every figure names who reported it, and when. She is checking someone else's work, not risking her own.",
      "start": 39.237,
      "dur": 8.82,
      "end": 48.057
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "scene": "s3",
      "text": "In Hindi. In Tamil. The whole interface, not a chatbot bolted on.",
      "start": 48.657,
      "dur": 7.303,
      "end": 55.96
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "scene": "s4",
      "text": "Then she waits.",
      "start": 56.96,
      "dur": 1.312,
      "end": 58.272
    },
    {
      "id": "l12",
      "scene": "s4",
      "text": "Seventy one days. This is everything she is told.",
      "start": 61.172,
      "dur": 4.848,
      "end": 66.02
    },
    {
      "id": "l13",
      "scene": "s4",
      "text": "So make the waiting legible. Seven steps, and you see where you are.",
      "start": 66.77,
      "dur": 5.95,
      "end": 72.72
    },
    {
      "id": "l14",
      "scene": "s4",
      "text": "The step holding your money names its own reason,",
      "start": 73.32,
      "dur": 3.406,
      "end": 76.726
    },
    {
      "id": "l15",
      "scene": "s4",
      "text": "and carries the button that releases it.",
      "start": 76.926,
      "dur": 2.696,
      "end": 79.623
    },
    {
      "id": "l16",
      "scene": "s5",
      "text": "When something comes back, it comes back written in law.",
      "start": 80.473,
      "dur": 4.012,
      "end": 84.484
    },
    {
      "id": "l17",
      "scene": "s5",
      "text": "Say it in money and days. If she says nothing by the fourteenth of September, it becomes final and is taken from her refund.",
      "start": 84.834,
      "dur": 10.108,
      "end": 94.942
    },
    {
      "id": "l18",
      "scene": "s6",
      "text": "Three acts, one journey. File by confirming. Understand what comes back. Watch the money move.",
      "start": 95.642,
      "dur": 10.183,
      "end": 105.825
    },
    {
      "id": "l19",
      "scene": "s6",
      "text": "Wahpsee. The return, and your money coming back.",
      "start": 106.275,
      "dur": 4.636,
      "end": 110.911
    },
    {
      "id": "l20",
      "scene": "s6",
      "text": "Round one closes on the twenty eighth of August, at eight in the evening.",
      "start": 111.411,
      "dur": 5.155,
      "end": 116.566
    }
  ],
